{"id":55222,"date":"2026-07-28T14:17:26","date_gmt":"2026-07-28T13:17:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=55222"},"modified":"2026-08-26T18:24:52","modified_gmt":"2026-08-26T17:24:52","slug":"baleeiros-hybrid-games","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/baleeiros-hybrid-games\/","title":{"rendered":"Baleeiros Hybrid Games 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 1: Descri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">Sobre a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Baleeiros Hybrid Games 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    O Baleeiros Hybrid Games 2026 celebra o esp\u00edrito desafiador dos baleeiros da Ilha de Santa Maria, combinando corrida costeira com provas funcionais de for\u00e7a e agilidade.\n  <\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Planeia a tua corrida com a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e explora o <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calendario-de-corridas\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas de Portugal<\/a>.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 2: Ficha T\u00e9cnica --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica do <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Evento<\/span><\/h3>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data Oficial:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">27 de Agosto de 2026 (Quinta-feira)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udccd Localiza\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Vila do Porto, Ilha de Santa Maria (A\u00e7ores)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Desafios H\u00edbridos de Corrida e For\u00e7a em Equipas e Individuais<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Tipo de Piso:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Asfalto costeiro, areal e esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais de Vila do Porto<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Organiza\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Clube Naval de Vila do Porto \/ CM Vila do Porto<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 3: Geometria da Prova --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Percurso<\/span><\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Desenrola-se junto \u00e0 Marina de Vila do Porto e ao Forte de S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s, enfrentando obst\u00e1culos atl\u00e9ticos e corrida de endurance.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 4: Banner Calculadora --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card pr-calc-event-banner\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.05) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h4 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Calcula o teu Pace para a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Prova<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Gere o esfor\u00e7o ideal e calcula os teus tempos de prova.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 0%, #8B5CF6 100%); color: #1E1B4B; font-weight: 800; padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 30px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;\">Abrir Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a><\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 5: Onde Ficar --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Ficar em Vila do Porto<\/span><\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Recomenda-se o Hotel Colombo, Pousada de Juventude de Santa Maria e os alojamentos locais no centro de Vila do Porto.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 6: Sobre a Regi\u00e3o & Gastronomia --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre a Regi\u00e3o &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Gastronomia<\/span><\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Delicia-te com a famosa Sopa de Peixe de Santa Maria, a Caldeirada \u00e0 Baleeiro, os biscoitos de orelha e as meloas de Santa Maria.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 7: Perguntas Frequentes --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card pr-faq-section\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Frequentes<\/span><\/h3>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">Realiza-se na quinta-feira, 27 de Agosto de 2026, em Vila do Porto, na Ilha de Santa Maria, A\u00e7ores.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais s\u00e3o efetuadas no portal do Clube Naval de Vila do Porto em baleeiroshybridgames.pt.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem pode participar no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">O evento est\u00e1 aberto a atletas individuais e equipas em escal\u00f5es masculinos, femininos e mistos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o formato do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">Combina corrida costeira junto \u00e0 Marina de Vila do Porto com esta\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00e9cnicas de for\u00e7a e resist\u00eancia.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde consultar classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e fotos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">Os tempos e fotos oficiais s\u00e3o publicados nas plataformas do Clube Naval e divulgados no Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o levantamento do kit?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">O levantamento do kit de atleta realiza-se na sede do Clube Naval de Vila do Porto nas v\u00e9speras da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":55223,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,519],"event_type_2":[104,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-55222","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-ilha-do-pico","event_type-corrida","event_type-obstaculos","event_type_2-acores","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/6a6729dbc13ff_Cartaz-cartaz_460.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/55222","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{